<title>UK: UK's Limelight Group to float shares at 175p.</title>
<headline>UK's Limelight Group to float shares at 175p.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Limelight Group Plc, a retailer and manufacturer of fully fitted home improvement products, said on Thursday it would float at 175p, valuing the company at 175.0 million stg.</p>
<p>All 65.05 million shares on offer were allotted in a placing and offer to intermediaries and the group's employees.</p>
<p>&quot;We are delighted with the response to the offer and welcome our new shareholders at this exciting time in the company's development,&quot; said chief executive Stephen Cotter.</p>
<p>Dealing in the shares is due to begin on Friday November 15.</p>
<p>-- John Sutherland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7945</p>
